---
import FamilyImage from "../../assets/family.png";
import HouseKeys from "../../assets/keys.png";
---

<section class="min-h-[80vh] mt-10 px-5">
  <h2 class="text-2xl font-medium text-[#b3b3b3]">
    This is not just about{" "}
    <span class="font-semibold text-[#5B4F3F]">real estate</span>
  </h2>
  <div class="grid grid-cols-2 mt-10 relative">
    <img src={FamilyImage.src} class="h-64 w-64" alt="family-image" />
    <img
      src={HouseKeys.src}
      alt="house-keys"
      class="mt-5 h-64 w-64 -right-2 top-10 absolute"
    />
  </div>
  <div class="mt-32 space-y-4">
    <p class="leading-7">
      It’s about family. Home. Pure comfort. You’re not just looking for four
      walls. You’re looking for a place to finally settle in and thrive.
    </p>
    <p class="font-semibold text-[#5B4F3F]">That’s what we help you find.</p>
  </div>
</section>
